    "Comprehensive guide and reference for the Antigravity Customization System. Use to explain how customizations work, their loading priority, discovery mechanisms, and to guide the creation of skills, rules, plugins, hooks, and MCP servers.": "Antigravity 自定义扩展系统完整指南：讲解规则、技能、插件、钩子与 MCP 服务的加载优先级与编写方法。",
    "Provides a comprehensive guide, quick reference, and sitemap for Google Antigravity (AGY), including the Antigravity CLI (agy), Antigravity 2.0, Antigravity IDE, Python SDK, slash commands, keybindings, and customizations (skills, rules, MCP, sidecars). Activate this skill when the user asks questions about how to use, configure, or customize Antigravity, AGY, the agy CLI, the Antigravity IDE, or Antigravity 2.0.": "Google Antigravity (AGY) 全景使用指南与速查：涵盖桌面端 2.0、IDE、CLI、Python SDK、斜杠命令与自定义扩展。",
    "Interactive guide to design and create a scheduled background automation. Use this skill when the user wants to create an automated or recurring scheduled task (e.g. \"summarize my emails every morning\", \"every Monday send me a to-do list\"). Also triggered by the /automation slash command.": "交互式设计与创建定时/周期性后台自动化任务向导（如每日摘要、每周待办提醒）。",
    "How to render rich interactive HTML widgets inline in the chat or as standalone artifacts. Use this skill when you want to show the user diagrams, data visualizations, interactive controls, educational walkthroughs, or any rich visual content beyond plain text and markdown.": "在对话中内嵌或作为独立产物渲染交互式 HTML 微件、图表、数据可视化与动态控件。",
    "Automatically migrate legacy workflows to modern skills across global and workspace configurations. Scans for existing workflows, creates target SKILL.md files, and safely archives old workflow files.": "自动扫描并将旧版工作流（workflows）迁移为新版技能（SKILL.md），同时安全归档旧文件。",
    "How to manage and create plugins — namespaced bundles of skills, agents, rules, MCP servers and hooks that install, enable and disable as a single unit. Use this skill when the user wants to enable, disable, install or uninstall a plugin, when they want to create a new plugin, or when a new customization should be packaged into a plugin rather than left loose. Also triggered by the /plugin slash command. Don't use for the underlying customization system itself — discovery roots, loading priority, or authoring a standalone skill, agent, rule, hook or MCP server outside a plugin; see the customizations guide skill for those.": "创建、安装、启停与卸载插件（将技能、规则、钩子、MCP 服务与侧边栏打包为统一扩展单元）。",
    "Build, package, run, and debug UI extensions for Antigravity: interactive web panels that render in the side pane, served by a Node.js sidecar using the built-in Sidecar SDK.": "使用内置 Sidecar SDK 构建、打包、运行与调试 Antigravity 侧边栏交互式 Web 扩展面板。",
    "Discover UI plugin panels relevant to the current task and surface a one-click pill in chat to open (toggle) them in the side pane. Use when a running UI plugin's panel would help with what the user is doing, or right after the user enables a new UI plugin pane and a shortcut to open it is handy.": "发现与当前任务相关的侧边栏 UI 插件面板，并在对话中提供一键打开快捷按钮。",
